{{ ref: 08a96461-ecdf-40a4-b437-2ed070d955d8 }}
- **Scope**: `crates/core/src/cluster/` — coarsening, seeding, and refinement. Consumes the layered condensation from commit 2; produces nested container assignments (folders → domains → packages → package groups).
--{ ref: 08a96461-ecdf-40a4-b437-2ed070d955d8 }--
{{ ref: 212b1537-7b21-47ae-b8cc-89b736b68c8c }}
- **Description**: dagP-style multilevel clustering where acyclicity is an inviolable veto, not a penalty. Coarsening never merges a cycle-creating pair; seeding grows clusters along topological order; FM refinement accepts a move only if the quotient stays acyclic (incremental check — the hot path) and the target cluster respects its member cap. Cohesion bonuses (naming, path) live inside the gain function.
--{ ref: 212b1537-7b21-47ae-b8cc-89b736b68c8c }--

